 conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills, concerns: pretentious, wrong tone, nasty remarks, grumpy, uncooperative, weak memory for numbers. C: correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education, puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills, 100% reliable, positive crew atmosphere, calm in crisis.\n\nWe need to consider criteria: reliability, stress resilience, technical competence, calmness under pressure, cooperation, responsibility, etc. B strong on reliability (conscientious) and stress, technical (weather, computer). C strong on reliability (100% reliable), calmness, decision quality, attention, crew atmosphere. B's attitude issues are serious. C's communication difficulty and egocentric are concerns but maybe less severe.\n\nThus we might shift to C. As Agent 3, we can say after hearing arguments, I now recommend Candidate C, citing reliability, calmness, decision quality, crew atmosphere, and note that communication issues can be mitigated.\n\nWe must reference prior discussion: mention Agent 1 and 2's points, and our own earlier stance.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with the shift to Candidate C...\" etc.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_3\",\"vote\":\"Candidate C\"}\n\nProceed."}
